FRONTEND: Next.js (React) chatbot + progress bar
------------------------------------------------------------

This is a dummy UI example.
When user clicks Send, it sends message to backend websocket.
Frontend listens to websocket updates:
- if type="progress" -> show progress bar + text
- if type="final" -> add bot response to chat and hide progress bar

